    "An uplifting or reflective title alone seems to count too heavily as a match; I also need a connection to the performers or musical style I enjoy."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest interaction with The Most Relaxing Classical Music in the Universe suggests that calm listening deserves more attention alongside my interest in expressive vocals.",
    "My Christmas selections were grouped together in an earlier visit, whereas my later listening included several nonseasonal albums; those choices reflect different listening occasions."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in expressive vocals but carry my earlier Christmas listening too strongly into a visit when I want relaxed, nonseasonal music."
}
